===== Bootloader mods =====

The stock bootloader is [[docs:techref:bootloader:cfe#bcm63xx_cfe|BCM63xx-flavour CFE]] and supports web and TFTP flashing.  It seemingly **doesn't** allow full [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.broadcom.bcm63xx#dump_the_flash|dumping]]; when you dump flash beyond the first megabyte you get what appear to be page faults.  Maybe it just needs a different address, or maybe CFE doesn't fully map the SPI flash?

